        "original_id": "c2cb8228-e0db-56e0-93b8-1aecb45ad96e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Anita Dobson, Brian Croucher, Fenella Fielding, Sheila Ferguson, Jessica Martin, Lorraine Chase, Gillian Gregory, Mark Lester, Jessie Wallace, Barbara Windsor, Shani Wallis\n- Organizations: The Music Hall Guild of Great Britain and America, BBC\n- Products: EastEnders, \"Anyone Can Fall in Love\"\n\nFacts:\n- From 1985 to 1988, Anita Dobson played Angie Watts in the BBC soap opera \"EastEnders\".\n- In 1986, Anita Dobson reached number four in the UK Singles Chart with \"Anyone Can Fall in Love,\" a song based on the theme music of \"EastEnders\".\n- The Music Hall Guild of Great Britain and America includes Brian Croucher, Anita Dobson, Fenella Fielding, Sheila Ferguson, Jessica Martin, Lorraine Chase, Gillian Gregory, Mark Lester, Jessie Wallace, Barbara Windsor, and Shani Wallis among its patrons.",
